al sports club right in your headset. Perfect for all skill levels, with easy-to-pick-up mechanics and deep gameplay for pros.\n\nGet ready to move, sweat, and have a blast SportsVRX is your all access pass to nonstop VR sports action!", "short_description": "Step into the ultimate virtual arena with SportsVRX - All in 1 Sports Games, where your favorite sports come to life in one immersive package! Whether you're aiming for a perfect putt, serving aces, or going for a slam dunk, SportsVRX delivers realistic, physics-driven gameplay that feels just like the real thing."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "31061370923461409"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818916_2150848728769590_6673883793817030463_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E3_-S5_si9IQ7kNvwGJMprX&_nc_oc=AdknAcoddhUodcSv5LjmTSiMYj9_uNrjbSemd45YVUsEb05ywho_tgvrYKC-X70bfUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw8c1WdIT3dBgWDELOJ0wwzThLMbJzRC-HZ-y25Ftv3IA&oe=69AC1ADD"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": fals